The PKN determines the set of equations within the logic-ODE model, as an ODE is fitted to every protein (i.e., node xi, Equation 1). For each ODE, Bi is a continuous update function that indicates the regulation by Ni upstream nodes. The sigmoidal transfer function \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
